### 6.1 Public marketplace (`/marketplace` + `/marketplace/:presetId`)
Root-level (outside `/app`), reachable while logged out — this is the actual destination the landing page, site-nav, and marketplace teaser should point to (go back and update those three links from Phase 4 §2.1–2.3 now that this exists, removing the `TODO(phase5)` comments you left).

