- **Step 2** (skipped if step 1 was `Public free` or `Unlisted`): price input (₹, matching the range already seen in `MARKETPLACE_PRESETS` — roughly ₹99–₹799), and a checkbox "I agree to the marketplace revenue-share terms" linking to `/legal/terms` — the button to continue is disabled until checked.
- **Step 3**: description `Textarea` (pre-filled from `bot.description`), a multi-select `checklist`-style tag picker (reuse categories already seen in `MARKETPLACE_PRESETS`: Starter, Debate, Options, Momentum, plus let the user type a custom tag).
